> f(v: u8) = u8((u8(v) << 2) | (v >> 4))
> g(v: u8) = u8(4 * u32(v) + (u32(v) >> 4))
> f2(v: u8) = (u8((u8(v) << 2) | (v >> 4))) * 1
> g2(v: u8) = (u8(4 * u32(v) + (u32(v) >> 4))) * 1
> f1(v: u8) = (u8((u8(v) << 2) | (v >> 4))) * 1
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 112 points, e.g. v=65: 4 vs 8
> equiv f2 g2
f2 and g2 differ at 112 points, e.g. v=65: 4 vs 8
> equiv f1 g
f1 and g differ at 112 points, e.g. v=65: 4 vs 8
> equiv f f2
f and f2 are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
